    "title": "GRID3 NGA - Operational Wards v2.0",
    "description": "The current version supersedes the GRID3 NGA - Operational Wards v1.0 dataset for these states: Adamawa, Bauchi, Bayelsa, Borno, Delta, Gombe, Jigawa, Kano, Katsina, Kwara, Ogun, Osun, Oyo, Yobe. The following changes were made: Updated wards’ geometry Harmonized wards’ names For more information on the methodology and data sources used during the production of these data, click here.",
